  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p style='margin:0px 0px 12px; font-size:16px; box-sizing:border-box; max-width:100%; font-family:Lato, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;;'>This dataset contains benthic macroinvertebrate data from CVC Benthic (monitoring) Database for the period 1999 to 2025. CVC-collected data only. </p><p style='margin:0px 0px 12px; font-size:16px; box-sizing:border-box; max-width:100%; font-family:Lato, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;;'>Click for metadata here: <a href='https://camaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/6441e4dd97974599ac8bbd156f1d92fc/data' style='color:rgb(0, 125, 165); text-decoration:none; font-family:inherit; box-sizing:border-box; background-color:transparent; max-width:100%;' rel='nofollow ugc'>Benthic macroinvertebrate records metadata (1999-2025)</a></p><p style='margin:0px 0px 12px; font-size:16px; box-sizing:border-box; max-width:100%; font-family:Lato, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;;'>How to download this data:</p><p style='margin:0px 0px 12px; font-size:16px; box-sizing:border-box; max-width:100%; font-family:Lato, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;;'>1. Scroll down to the Layers section and click the layer name: <u>BenthicMacroinvertebrateRecords_1999_2025</u></p><p style='margin:0px 0px 12px; font-size:16px; box-sizing:border-box; max-width:100%; font-family:Lato, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;;'>2. To download the whole dataset: click the Download button and choose your preferred format (CSV, Shapefile, GeoJSON, etc.).</p><p style='margin:0px 0px 12px; font-size:16px; box-sizing:border-box; max-width:100%; font-family:Lato, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;;'>3. To download only specific/filtered records,  visit the <a href='https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/422f271424644cd79307f96c6bbbd7b8' style='color:rgb(0, 125, 165); text-decoration:none; font-family:inherit; box-sizing:border-box; background-color:transparent; max-width:100%;' rel='nofollow ugc'>interactive mapping</a>.</p><p style='margin:0px 0px 12px; font-size:16px; box-sizing:border-box; max-width:100%; font-family:Lato, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;;'>💡 Tip: Clicking on a point on the map opens an attribute info window with details for that record. You can dock or undock this window.</p><p style='margin:0px 0px 12px; font-size:16px; box-sizing:border-box; max-width:100%; font-family:Lato, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;;'>NOTE: This dataset cannot be downloaded directly from ArcGIS Online; please use the CVC's Open Data portal to download the data.</p>"
